<title>BOSNIA: Bosnian Croats expel Moslems despite pledges.</title>
<headline>Bosnian Croats expel Moslems despite pledges.</headline>
<byline>Dan De Luce</byline>
<dateline>SARAJEVO 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Several Bosnian Moslem families were expelled from Croat-held western Mostar overnight despite solemn pledges from Croat authorities to put a halt to &quot;ethnic cleansing&quot;, U.N. police monitors reported on Thursday.</p>
